<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_action_debug_base">ActionDebugBase</link></para>

<para>Base class for debugging actions across different services (MySQL, MariaDB, Apache, PostgreSQL). This class provides common functionality for executing debug commands and displaying their output. Child classes need to implement service-specific methods to define their behavior.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>Since</title>

<para>2026.2.16 </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
<para>
Definition at line <link linkend="_class_8action_8debug_base_8php_source_1l00019">19</link> of file <link linkend="_class_8action_8debug_base_8php_source">class.action.debugBase.php</link>.</para>
</section>
